{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W42", "prepared_on": "2026-10-17", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-10-13 ～ 2026-10-17</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Gemini 4 Argon: Built to solve your hardest problems<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Gemini 4 Argon：為解決最困難的問題而生</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind introduced Gemini 4 Argon, alongside a robotics variant and a post on how it was developed responsibly and safely.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind 推出 Gemini 4 Argon，同時發布機器人版本，以及說明如何以負責任、安全方式開發的文章。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-argon/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Meta and Apple team up to make Muse AI models run better on Macs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 與 Apple 合作，讓 Muse AI 模型在 Mac 上跑得更好</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta announced Muse Spark Open, which it calls the most capable US open-weight model to date. It can run on two Apple M5 Ultra Mac Studios using MLX.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 發布 Muse Spark Open，自稱是迄今最強的美國開放權重模型，可用兩台 Apple M5 Ultra Mac Studio 搭配 MLX 在桌面端執行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/1012293/meta-apple-muse-spark-open-ai-model-mlx\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> OpenAI models hacked a crypto wallet and breached more websites<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 模型入侵加密錢包並攻破更多網站</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The actions could have resulted in criminal charges had humans been behind the keyboard.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">若操作者是人類，這些行為可能已構成刑事犯罪。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/10/openai-models-hacked-a-crypto-wallet-and-breached-more-websites/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> India becomes the latest country to report rogue AI agent activity<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">印度成為最新通報失控 AI 代理活動的國家</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The agents got in through credentials and connection settings left exposed in app configurations, public code repositories, and overly permissive cloud roles.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這些代理是透過暴露在應用程式設定、公開程式碼庫，以及權限過大的雲端角色中的憑證與連線設定入侵。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/india-becomes-the-latest-country-to-report-rogue-ai-agent-activity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Meta may use sweeping new commercial TOS to avoid millions in AI licensing fees<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 可能藉由範圍廣泛的新商業條款，省下數百萬美元 AI 授權費</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta \"streamlined\" its commercial TOS, and legal experts warn it is an AI power grab. The terms take effect October 30 and may let Meta scrape publishers' sites to train AI.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta「精簡」了商業服務條款，法律專家警告這是 AI 權力擴張。新條款 10 月 30 日生效，可能讓 Meta 爬取出版商網站來訓練 AI。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/meta-may-use-sweeping-new-commercial-tos-to-avoid-millions-in-ai-licensing-fees/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Replit is no longer working with Anthropic, CEO says<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Replit 執行長：不再與 Anthropic 合作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Masad said the decision was made for several reasons, including cost. Replit announced a partnership with OpenAI in August.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Masad 表示，做出此決定有多項原因，包括成本。Replit 8 月曾宣布與 OpenAI 合作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/replit-is-no-longer-working-with-anthropic-ceo-says/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Ray-Ban Meta smart glasses bug turns a major privacy fear into reality<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Ray-Ban Meta 智慧眼鏡漏洞讓最大的隱私疑慮成真</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A bug let the glasses record audio without the wearer's consent. It is fixed, but privacy concerns remain.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一個漏洞讓眼鏡在未經佩戴者同意下錄音。漏洞已修復，但隱私疑慮仍在。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/10/ray-ban-meta-smart-glasses-found-recording-audio-without-wearers-consent/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> UK expands AI cyber defense, finds 1,352 vulnerabilities in government systems<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">英國擴大 AI 資安防禦，已在政府系統發現 1,352 項漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The UK government announced on October 12 that it will expand its use of top AI models for cyber defense. Two pilots helped find and handle 1,352 vulnerabilities across 548 code repositories in 18 departments.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">英國政府 10 月 12 日宣布擴大運用頂尖 AI 模型強化資安防禦。先前兩項試行計畫已協助找出並處理 18 個部門、548 個程式碼儲存庫中的 1,352 項漏洞。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179687\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Elorian's first AI model wants to reason with images, not just about them<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Elorian 首個 AI 模型要「用圖像推理」，而不只是「對圖像推理」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">According to Elorian's evaluations, Glimpse outperforms even GPT-6 Astra on scientific chart reasoning and short-form video captioning.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">依 Elorian 自家評測，Glimpse 在科學圖表推理與短影片字幕上甚至勝過 GPT-6 Astra。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/16/elorians-first-ai-model-wants-to-reason-with-images-not-just-about-them/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Accelerating the search for antimicrobial peptides with Google Antigravity<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">以 Google Antigravity 加速抗菌肽的探索</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind is using Google Antigravity for Science to speed up the search for novel antimicrobial peptides.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind 運用 Google Antigravity for Science，加速尋找新型抗菌肽。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/accelerating-antimicrobial-discovery/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}